Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Through the crack in the door, I saw Dad take off his coat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.82,0:00:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He was drunk. He was swaying.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.48,0:00:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He didn't hear me step up behind him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.52,0:00:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I hit him on the back of the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.04,0:00:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He fell heavily against the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.12,0:00:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Surprised, he turned around.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.36,0:00:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I waited a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.34,0:00:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I hit him again.
